      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后是唯独爱你和机伶金花。\n在聚光灯照耀下，\n她们的决胜服闪烁着耀眼光芒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d82e76e6b2f942fe06c0df8e95aa51cf36eb65343b23e63654c32a0e0d3a46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
